## Test Anti-Pattern Audit: `ProductCatalogTests.cs`

### Summary

**10 tests, 9 findings: 6 Critical, 1 Medium, 2 Low**

This is a textbook **coverage-touching** suite. Every public method is called, achieving high line coverage, but almost nothing is *verified*. Bugs in price calculations, CSV parsing, search logic, and removal would all slip through undetected.

---

### 🔴 Critical — False Confidence

#### 1. Coverage-Touching Pattern (Systemic)

The entire file methodically calls each public method without meaningful assertions. 6 of 10 tests have **zero assertions**; 3 more assert only `IsNotNull` (which tells you nothing useful about correctness).

#### 2. No Assertions — `AddProduct_Works` (line 17)

```csharp
// BEFORE — proves nothing
_catalog.AddProduct(product);

// FIX — verify the product is retrievable
_catalog.AddProduct(product);
var stored = _catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001");
Assert.AreEqual("Widget", stored!.Name);
Assert.AreEqual(9.99m, stored.Price);
```

#### 3. No Assertions — `UpdatePrice_Works` (line 33)

```csharp
// BEFORE — price could stay 9.99 and test still passes
_catalog.UpdatePrice("SKU-001", 14.99m);

// FIX — verify the mutation
_catalog.UpdatePrice("SKU-001", 14.99m);
var updated = _catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001");
Assert.AreEqual(14.99m, updated!.Price);
```

#### 4. No Assertions — `RemoveProduct_Works` (line 39)

```csharp
// BEFORE
_catalog.RemoveProduct("SKU-001");

// FIX
_catalog.RemoveProduct("SKU-001");
Assert.IsNull(_catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001"));
```

#### 5. No Assertions — `GetProductCount_Works` (line 63)

```csharp
// BEFORE — doesn't even capture the return value usefully
var count = _catalog.GetProductCount();

// FIX
Assert.AreEqual(0, _catalog.GetProductCount());
_catalog.AddProduct(new Product("SKU-001", "Widget", 9.99m));
Assert.AreEqual(1, _catalog.GetProductCount());
```

#### 6. No Assertions — `ApplyBulkDiscount_Works` (line 69)

This is the most dangerous gap — bulk discount math bugs would go straight to production.

```csharp
// BEFORE
_catalog.ApplyBulkDiscount(0.10m);

// FIX
_catalog.ApplyBulkDiscount(0.10m);
Assert.AreEqual(8.991m, _catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001")!.Price);
Assert.AreEqual(17.991m, _catalog.GetProduct("SKU-002")!.Price);
```

#### 7. No Assertions — `ImportFromCsv_Works` (line 85)

```csharp
// BEFORE
_catalog.ImportFromCsv("SKU-001,Widget,9.99");

